# 💡 Interview Tips

✅ DP on Subsequences = Pick / Not Pick.

✅ Subset Sum is the base problem.

✅ Partition Equal Sum reduces to Subset Sum.

✅ Knapsack is one of the most important DP problems.

✅ Learn state definition carefully.

